				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17221&amp;sid=992607894d23a0c7902dc93d8c646828"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I am proud to hear that you have had as much luck as I have found within the realms in regards to these formidable beasts that have against risen in the lands.
<br />

<br />
I have since relinquished a Frenzied Ghoul of it's enchanted black belt. I have torn the crown from the head of King Tranix. and all with the aid of the axe I wrenched from the hands of the Executioner within the relams of Lower Guk.
<br />

<br />
There are many more things to be found... Keep your eyes open everyone and good luck fighting these beasts that have been enchanted by the dark powers.
<br />

<br />
